#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"👋 <b>Hi {name}!</b>\n"
"\n"
"I track online prices and let you know when they drop.\n"
"\n"
"🚀 <b>To get started:</b> paste a link in the chat\n"
"🎯 <b>Supported:</b> Amazon, eBay, Shopify and more\n"
"🛡 <b>Amazon:</b> new/used and seller filters\n"
"\n"
"Press /menu for everything else."
